    {
        "id": "ja:word:stationery-scissors",
        "label": "はさみ",
        "class": "lexical:noun",
        "fields": {
            "pronunciation": ["はさみ"],
            "usage_notes": {
                "en": "A cutting tool with two pivoting blades. English scissors takes plural agreement: The scissors are here. One tool is a pair of scissors, not a scissor. Japanese はさみ does not itself mark singular or plural.",
                "de": "Ein Schneidwerkzeug mit zwei beweglichen Klingen. Englisch scissors verlangt den Plural: The scissors are here. Ein Werkzeug heißt a pair of scissors, nicht a scissor. Japanisch はさみ kennzeichnet allein keinen Numerus.",
                "id": "Alat potong dengan dua bilah berporos. Scissors dalam bahasa Inggris memakai kesesuaian jamak: The scissors are here. Satu alat disebut a pair of scissors, bukan a scissor. はさみ tidak menandai tunggal atau jamak.",
                "ja": "支点で動く二枚の刃を持つ切る道具。英語scissorsは複数扱いです：The scissors are here. 一つはa pair of scissorsといい、a scissorではありません。日本語はさみ自体は単複を表しません。"
            },
            "reference_images": [
                "images/c5725c620dcda187dd2fb11d60d3cc5483565b0e5b9393ac3601b4eebc99ac7b.jpg"
            ],
